begin="00:28.708" end="00:28.979">so </span><span begin="00:28.979" end="00:29.907">happy </span><span begin="00:29.907" end="00:30.307">you </span><span begin="00:30.307" end="00:30.579">could </span><span begin="00:30.579" end="00:32.628">die</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.659" end="00:38.187"><span begin="00:34.659" end="00:34.995">I </span><span begin="00:34.995" end="00:35.251">told </span><span begin="00:35.251" end="00:35.643">myself </span><span begin="00:35.643" end="00:35.883">that </span><span begin="00:35.883" end="00:36.107">you </span><span begin="00:36.107" end="00:36.379">were </span><span begin="00:36.379" end="00:36.827">right </span><span begin="00:36.827" end="00:37.315">for </span><span begin="00:37.315" end="00:38.187">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.467" end="00:41.491"><span begin="00:38.467" end="00:38.683">But </span><span begin="00:38.683" end="00:38.931">felt </span><span begin="00:38.931" end="00:39.195">so </span><span begin="00:39.195" end="00:39.772">lonely </span><span begin="00:39.772" end="00:39.947">in </span><span begin="00:39.947" end="00:40.195">your </span><span begin="00:40.195" end="00:41.491">company</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.187" end="00:47.279"><span begin="00:42.187" end="00:42.419">But </span><span begin="00:42.419" end="00:42.635">that </span><span begin="00:42.635" end="00:42.883">was </span><span begin="00:42.883" end="00:43.171">love </span><span begin="00:43.171" end="00:43.379">and </span><span begin="00:43.379" end="00:43.588">it's </span><span begin="00:43.588" end="00:43.843">an </span><span begin="00:43.843" end="00:44.259">ache </span><span begin="00:44.259" end="00:44.724">I </span><span begin="00:44.724" end="00:45.211">still </span><span begin="00:45.211" end="00:47.279">remember</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.455" end="01:09.727"><span begin="01:04.455" end="01:04.671">You </span><span begin="01:04.671" end="01:04.847">can </span><span begin="01:04.847" end="